.*
.* QUIDSPMFS: DSPMFSINF and STATFS, the attributes of the file system an
.* object is in, in the primary's layout (golden/nfs/dspmfsinf-*).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 44'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=FSTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=BLKSIZE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=TOTBLK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=FREEBLK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLNK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DIRLNK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=NAMEMAX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PATHMAX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CHOWN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=NOTRUNC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CASE CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPMFSINF KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPMFSINF ENTER='RETURN 0'.Display Mounted FS Information
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=IND.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=FSTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/FSTYPE'.File system type
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=BLKSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/BLKSIZE'.Block size
:DATAI VAR=TOTBLK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TOTBLK'.Total blocks
:DATAI VAR=FREEBLK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/FREEBLK'.Blocks free
:DATAI VAR=OBJLNK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJLNK'.Object link maximum
:DATAI VAR=DIRLNK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DIRLNK'.Directory link maximum
:DATAI VAR=NAMEMAX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NAMEMAX'.Pathname component maximum
:DATAI VAR=PATHMAX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PATHMAX'.Path name maximum
:DATAI VAR=CHOWN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CHOWN'.Change owner restricted
:DATAI VAR=NOTRUNC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NOTRUNC'.No truncation
:DATAI VAR=CASE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CASE'.Case Sensitivity
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPMFSINF.Display Mounted FS Information - Help
:P.The attributes of the file system an object is in: its type, its size
and free space in blocks, the limits on links and names, and how it treats
owners, long names and case.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave.
:EHELP.
.* Item help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:P.The path name given on the command; the attributes are those of the file system it is in.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FSTYPE'.File system type
:P.The file system the object is in: "root" (/), /QOpenSys, /QSYS.LIB, /QOPT, a user-defined file system's path, or a remote mount's server and path.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/BLKSIZE'.Block size
:P.The size in bytes of the file system's blocks, the unit of the two counts below.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TOTBLK'.Total blocks
:P.How many blocks the file system has. A file system with no limit shows No maximum; one that keeps no count, Not defined.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FREEBLK'.Blocks free
:P.How many of the blocks are free now.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJLNK'.Object link maximum
:P.The most hard links an object other than a directory may have.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DIRLNK'.Directory link maximum
:P.The most links a directory may have, its entries included.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NAMEMAX'.Pathname component maximum
:P.The longest name one part of a path may have, in characters.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PATHMAX'.Path name maximum
:P.The longest path name the file system takes, or No maximum.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CHOWN'.Change owner restricted
:P.Yes when only a user with *ALLOBJ special authority, or the owner within limits, may change an object's owner.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NOTRUNC'.No truncation
:P.Yes when a name longer than the component maximum is refused rather than cut.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CASE'.Case Sensitivity
:P.Yes when names that differ only in case are different objects.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
